    "what_en": "When you ask about a past coding task, Claude first searches the saved sessions of various AI coding assistants on your computer, reads the relevant parts, and answers based on evidence rather than memory.",
    "when_en": "When you mention previous sessions or transcripts, or ask whether something was done before, Claude activates this skill to search local records.",
    "say_en": [
      {
        "text": "Find the session where I changed the dashboard yesterday",
        "note": "It returns a list with timestamps and paths."
      },
      {
        "text": "Search my previous sessions for any mention of proxy",
        "note": "It lists matching platforms and the reasons for each hit."
